diff --git a/doc/build/changelog/unreleased_12/4204.rst b/doc/build/changelog/unreleased_12/4204.rst
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..975330b3a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/build/changelog/unreleased_12/4204.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, sql
+    :tickets: 4204
+    :versions: 1.3.0b1
+
+    Fixed a regression that occurred from the previous fix to :ticket:`4204` in
+    version 1.2.5, where a CTE that refers to itself after the
+    :meth:`.CTE.alias` method has been called would not refer to iself
+    correctly.
